{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Segoe UI;}}\uc1\f0\fs22 SentinelLAN \u8212? K\u7871?t n\u7889?i thi\u7871?t b\u7883? v\u7899?i c\u244?ng ty\par\par Ch\u7881? c\u224?i Agent tr\u234?n thi\u7871?t b\u7883? \u273?\u432?\u7907?c c\u244?ng ty cho ph\u233?p qu\u7843?n l\u253?.\par\par Agent g\u7917?i tr\u7841?ng th\u225?i k\u7871?t n\u7889?i, m\u7913?c s\u7917? d\u7909?ng CPU, RAM, \u7893? \u273?\u297?a, phi\u234?n b\u7843?n h\u7879? \u273?i\u7873?u h\u224?nh v\u224? phi\u234?n b\u7843?n Agent t\u7899?i m\u225?y ch\u7911? c\u7911?a c\u244?ng ty.\par\par Agent kh\u244?ng thu th\u7853?p m\u7853?t kh\u7849?u, n\u7897?i dung g\u245? ph\u237?m ho\u7863?c t\u7921? ch\u7909?p m\u224?n h\u236?nh. \u7842?nh h\u7895? tr\u7907? do nh\u226?n vi\u234?n ch\u7911? \u273?\u7897?ng ch\u7885?n v\u224? g\u7917?i.\par\par T\u225?c v\u7909? qu\u7843?n tr\u7883? ph\u7909? thu\u7897?c quy\u7873?n c\u7911?a IT v\u224? c\u7845?u h\u236?nh cho ph\u233?p tr\u234?n thi\u7871?t b\u7883?. Quy\u7873?n kh\u243?a m\u225?y v\u224? c\u244? l\u7853?p m\u7841?ng th\u7853?t kh\u244?ng \u273?\u432?\u7907?c t\u7921? b\u7853?t khi c\u224?i \u273?\u7863?t.\par\par Sau khi c\u224?i, d\u225?n m\u227? k\u7871?t n\u7889?i do IT c\u7845?p v\u224?o c\u7917?a s\u7893? k\u7871?t n\u7889?i. M\u227? ch\u7881? d\u249?ng m\u7897?t l\u7847?n; \u273?\u227? d\u249?ng th\u236? kh\u244?ng th\u7875? d\u249?ng l\u7841?i d\u249? c\u242?n h\u7841?n.}
